@startuml
title 3.16.15 Complete a donation campaign
caption UC-162 | Planned | Proposed design
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor white
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
show footbox
<style>
lifeLine {
    LineStyle 0
}
</style>
skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ActorBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    GroupBackgroundColor white
    GroupHeaderBackgroundColor white
}

' Source: docs/requirements/uc.md
' Main entity migration: No migration: proposed entity only
' One-table abstraction: related repository reads/writes stay inside the service.
actor "Admin" as Actor
participant "Donation Campaign UI (proposed)" as Page
participant "Campaign API (proposed)" as API
participant "Campaign Service (proposed)" as Service
participant "donation_campaigns" as Table <<proposed entity>>

Actor -> Page: 1: Complete a donation campaign
activate Page
Page -> Page: 2: Confirm campaign completion
Page -> API: 3: Complete donation campaign (proposed interface)
activate API
API -> API: 4: Authenticate active session and require ADMIN role
alt Session and required permission are valid
    API -> API: 5: Proposed: validate campaign id and ADMIN completion permission
    alt Request input is valid
        API -> Service: 6: Complete a donation campaign for the current actor
        activate Service
        Service -> Service: 7: Begin proposed transaction
        Service -> Table: 8: Lock campaign and current completion state (proposed)
        activate Table
        Table --> Service: 9: Campaign or no record
        deactivate Table
        Service -> Service: 10: Check required approvals and evidence for all processed items\nthrough protected projections
        alt Campaign exists and completion requirements are satisfied
            Service -> Table: 11: Mark campaign completed and retain prior item outcomes (proposed)
            activate Table
            Table --> Service: 12: Proposed completion result
            deactivate Table
            Service -> Service: 13: Record completion audit and time; commit; never fabricate return\noutcomes
            Service --> API: 14: Completed campaign (proposed)
            API --> Page: 15: HTTP 200 (proposed): Completed campaign (proposed)
            Page --> Actor: 16: Display closed campaign and retained processing history
        else Campaign missing or required approval/evidence incomplete
            Service --> API: 11.1: Campaign cannot be completed
            API --> Page: 11.2: HTTP 404 or 409 (proposed)
            Page --> Actor: 11.3: Display error; do not report success
        end
        deactivate Service
    else Invalid request input
        API --> Page: 6.1: Proposed validation error response
        Page --> Actor: 6.2: Display validation errors; do not execute the operation
    end
else Missing/invalid session or required permission
    API --> Page: 5.1: Proposed authentication/access error response
    Page --> Actor: 5.2: Show session or access error; no protected result
end
deactivate API
deactivate Page

legend bottom left
PLANNED: API/UI and donation_campaigns table are proposed, not present in the runtime or migrations.
Required schema and policy design remain open.
endlegend

@enduml
